{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308","title":"Familiar Journal","zone":"Map 22","method":"Instance","cadence":"once","rewards":[208096],"requirements":{},"costs":[],"outcome":"guaranteed-progress","source":"https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","validation":{"sourceChecked":true,"completePath":true,"checkpointChecked":false,"playtested":false,"reviewedAt":"2026-10-25","gaps":[]},"walkthrough":{"version":2,"contentVersion":"2.4.0","routeIds":["att-208096-a76815162308"],"includesPrerequisites":true,"completeWhen":{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096},"nodes":[{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:get-krastinov-toy","kind":"observe","text":"If Memory of Scholomance is not already unlocked, obtain Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors using the complete Heroic Scholomance rare guide. You may instead bring a player who uses that toy at the later bone pile.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"],"recovery":{"text":"Open the linked Heroic Scholomance guide for the full three-boss route and rare check. A friend using the toy is an alternative only when Eva actually appears; do not create ownership on this character."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":88566}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"sharedSubguideId":"heroic-scholomance-krastinov","linkedGuideId":"att-88566-471161610f20"},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:ritual-materials","kind":"prepare","text":"For a new Spectral Essence, obtain three Dark Runes (20520) and five Essence of Undeath (12808), for example through a player-chosen Auction House purchase. Skip this preparation if you already have Spectral Essence.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/item=206365","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11285"],"recovery":{"text":"Dark Rune is the tradable item 20520, not Demonic Rune. Auction prices are unknown until inspected; Toybox never buys or spends for you. Check bank storage for an existing unique Spectral Essence first."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":13544,"quantity":1},{"all":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":20520,"quantity":3},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":12808,"quantity":5}]}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:get-krastinov-toy"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:modern-entry","kind":"travel","text":"Enter modern Scholomance and clear the path through its classrooms. Use Heroic if you still need the rare toy; with the toy available, the ritual’s modern dungeon visit can use Normal or Heroic.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"],"recovery":{"text":"Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},"destination":{"mapID":22,"x":0.6907,"y":0.7296,"label":"Modern Scholomance entrance","directions":"Enter Caer Darrow keep and use the ordinary dungeon portal, not Eva’s Enchanted Journal."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:ritual-materials"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:clear-chillheart","kind":"objective","text":"In the first classroom, defeat Instructor Chillheart. If her body falls but combat continues, destroy the phylactery and stay ahead of the advancing ice wall.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"],"recovery":{"text":"Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"evidenceDescriptor":{"kind":"encounter-defeated","encounterId":659,"scope":"current-instance"},"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:modern-entry"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:clear-jandice","kind":"objective","text":"Follow the dungeon passage into the illusion room and defeat Jandice Barov. When she splits, find and damage the real Jandice; leave the dangerous ground effects.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"],"recovery":{"text":"Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"evidenceDescriptor":{"kind":"encounter-defeated","encounterId":663,"scope":"current-instance"},"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:clear-chillheart"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:clear-rattlegore","kind":"objective","text":"Continue into the bone-filled chamber and defeat Rattlegore. Click a bone pile for Bone Armor if Bone Spike threatens you; avoid the blue Soulflame patches.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"],"recovery":{"text":"Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"evidenceDescriptor":{"kind":"encounter-defeated","encounterId":665,"scope":"current-instance"},"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:clear-jandice"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:lilian","kind":"objective","text":"Continue beyond the rare’s room to Lilian Voss. During her soul phase move away from the pursuing soul and the purple flames; let the scripted phases finish before continuing toward the headmaster.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59200"],"recovery":{"text":"Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:clear-rattlegore"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:gandling","kind":"objective","text":"Pass the Viewing Room and descend into Headmaster’s Retreat. Defeat Darkmaster Gandling. If Harsh Lesson teleports you away, clear the study-room enemies to return; dispelling a living subject can burst nearby undead.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59080"],"recovery":{"text":"Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:lilian"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:summon-eva","kind":"interact","text":"After Gandling, go to the upper central study room and stand by its bone pile. Use Krastinov’s Bag of Horrors, or have your companion use it there, to reveal Eva Sarkhoff. Remove the Surgical Alterations toy buff so she will speak to you.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"],"recovery":{"text":"The ordinary Caer Darrow ghost and the newly summoned dungeon Eva are different interactions. Check the upper room and bone pile, then remove the disguise. Continue only moves the cursor until her actual dialogue or item is observed."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":206365,"quantity":1},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":13544,"quantity":1}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:gandling"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:eva-dialogue","kind":"interact","text":"Speak with the revealed Eva and exhaust her ritual dialogue. Receive Inert Spectral Essence if you do not already have Spectral Essence. Loot Eva’s Femur from the adjacent bones.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/item=206365"],"recovery":{"text":"If no Inert Spectral Essence is offered, look for the existing unique trinket in bags or bank. Speak before trying to loot the femur; do not discard veteran items."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"all":[{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":206365,"quantity":1},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":13544,"quantity":1}]},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":206364,"quantity":1}]}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:summon-eva"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:eva-journal","kind":"collect","text":"Before leaving, return to the Viewing Room. Walk behind the southwestern bookcase near the doorway and collect Eva’s Journal from its shelf.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"],"recovery":{"text":"Recheck the named room, selected difficulty and current game objectives. Continue advances only the guide cursor; it never records a kill, unlock, purchase or ownership."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":206346,"quantity":1}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:eva-dialogue"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:restore-essence","kind":"craft","text":"Use Inert Spectral Essence with the three Dark Runes and five Essence of Undeath to restore Spectral Essence. Equip the restored trinket before looking for Caer Darrow’s ghosts.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096","https://www.wowhead.com/item=206365"],"recovery":{"text":"Restoring consumes the listed materials and is a player action. If the trinket is already restored, equip it rather than making another. Inventory possession alone does not prove that it is equipped."},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":13544,"quantity":1}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"consumesItems":[{"itemId":20520,"quantity":3},{"itemId":12808,"quantity":5}],"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:eva-journal"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:collect-water","kind":"collect","text":"Collect the water bucket beside the fountain.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"],"recovery":{"text":"These ritual objects require Eva’s introduction. Keep the live ritual items; already exchanged items need not be collected again. If the object is absent, check Eva’s dialogue and whether the matching candle is already in bags."},"destination":{"mapID":22,"x":0.688,"y":0.789,"label":"Water by Caer Darrow fountain"},"completeWhen":{"any":[{"any":[{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":206359,"quantity":1},{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":206354,"quantity":1}]},{"any":[{"kind":"itemCount","itemId":208096,"quantity":1},{"kind":"toyOwned","itemId":208096}]}]},"when":{"negate":{"any":[{"kind":"achievement","achievementId":18368,"scope":"account"},{"kind":"questTurnedIn","questId":76249,"cadence":"once","scope":"warband"}]}},"manual":true,"after":["att-208096-a76815162308:restore-essence"]},{"id":"att-208096-a76815162308:trade-water","kind":"purchase","text":"With Spectral Essence equipped, speak to Joseph Dirte and trade Caer Darrow Fountain Water for Stinky Candle. Confirm the trade yourself.","sources":["https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Instances.lua","https://github.com/ATTWoWAddon/AllTheThings/blob/52895ee664b61e08f091d514fe1556568d411570/db/Standard/Categories/Zones.lua","https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=18368","https://www.wowhead.com/item=208096"],"recovery":{"text":"If the ghost is invisible, equip Spectral Essence. Check the exact item and NPC; a trade consumes the memento. Do not infer it occurred from arrival